ith $i18n except identities (names); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A reader opened the bubble of a thread and pressed the arrow of Resolve, the three dots of the header, or the dots of a message; the menu opens under the control.","The base state is the Resolve menu of an open thread; the Variants show the other menus and the thread states that change them.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the menus are Workbench chrome, so their text follows the Workbench language and is baked here per Locale."],"intent":"Show the menus of the thread bubble as built from Adapter Widgets only: the Resolve menu behind the arrow of the split button, the thread menu behind the three dots of the header, and the menu of one message. What each offers, and what it leaves out for the reader or the thread at hand.","interactionRules":["The Resolve menu groups the answers under Resolve (Answered, and Verified on a ready-for-review thread, where it accepts the pending submission and is disabled when there is none) and the closings under Dismiss (No longer relevant, Duplicate…, Won't do); Duplicate asks for the thread it repeats first. The groups add no resolution kind: the one-click button keeps its meaning.","The thread menu offers Copy link, Submit for review… (an open thread, on a desktop layout), Re-anchor, Promote to Decision (a Create another Decision beside it once the thread already has one), Open in Reviews and Copy thread ID. Delete comment, in the error color and apart, is offered only to the author of a thread that no one has answered, and Delete empty thread to any member who may write Reviews, for a thread without messages.","On a phone the thread menu offers neither Re-anchor nor Promote to Decision; a thread becomes a Decision only through an explicit promotion.","A message's menu offers Edit to its author. A message written after the latest submission or resolution stays editable, even on a resolved thread; one that a submission or resolution came after is frozen: Edit stays in the menu, disabled, with the reason, and reopening never unfreezes it."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"sibling","type":"view","viewId":"c6c0a104-7b3e-4d19-8a26-3e9d1c0b6a04"}],"requirements":["01a11544-5727-7d41-b732-3108b15a8ec1"]},"variants":{"message-menu":{"requirements":["01a11544-5808-772e-800c-ed37332596e1","01a11544-5798-7401-bdaa-4dce41a6fc86"],"state":{"menu-message":{"visible":true},"menu-message-frozen":{"visible":false},"menu-overflow":{"visible":false},"menu-overflow-author":{"visible":false},"menu-overflow-empty":{"visible":false},"menu-overflow-phone":{"visible":false},"menu-overflow-promoted":{"visible":false},"menu-resolve":{"visible":false},"menu-resolve-ready":{"visible":false},"menu-resolve-ready-no-submission":{"visible":false}}},"message-menu-frozen":{"requirements":["01a11544-57e2-701c-946f-3fe75f5294ba","01a11544-593c-787b-9d25-34f9745ee674","01a115cd-2e6a-7911-9a3a-ef4a00e1339d"],"state":{"menu-message":{"visible":false},"menu-message-frozen":{"visible":true},"menu-overflow":{"visible":false},"menu-overflow-author":{"visible":false},"menu-overflow-empty":{"visible":false},"menu-overflow-phone":{"visible":false},"menu-overflow-promoted":{"visible":false},"menu-resolve":{"visible":false},"menu-resolve-ready":{"visible":false},"menu-resolve-ready-no-submission":{"visible":false}}},"resolve-ready":{"requirements":["01a11544-5727-7d41-b732-3108b15a8ec1","01a11544-5702-78b6-95ea-c15fe80ad4e3"],"state":{"h-status-open":{"visible":false},"h-status-ready":{"visible":true},"hint-accepts-wrap":{"visible":true},"hint-wrap":{"visible":false},"life-reopen":{"visible":true},"menu-message":